-text


Details  On March 19, 1997, ██████ Applewhite found SCP-5974 in the woods near his home. He proceeded to pick the cup up and the embedding process began. Moments later, the uncontrollable rampage began, and he proceeded to murder 38 individuals before exhaustion set in, causing his death.




Footnotes
1. SCP-5974’s effects have only been seen on humans, or humanoid creatures up to this point.
2. The effect can be reversed by refilling the cup with warm, freshly made black coffee.
3. This process has been observed to be as short as 10 seconds, and as long as two hours.
4. Out of the seven currently known incidents relating to SCP-5974, we only have knowledge of what happened on the final one.








                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
